        },
        {
          "text": "Anatukot a Ŋikristo, adau Akuj akiwuakin ŋituŋa loticisyo kec: ŋulu esyaunak erae ŋikiyakia, ŋulu a ŋiarei erae ŋikadwarak, ŋulu a ŋiuni erae ŋiketatamak, totupakis ŋulu etiyak ŋakujuwuanisya ka nabo ŋulu einakinitae apedor akitaŋaleunun ŋidekesyo; ŋice akiŋarakin ŋuluce, ŋice apolokinit ŋuluce ka ŋice daŋ akirworo ŋaŋajepa ŋuna egelaaka ŋuna ke Etau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
