        },
        {
          "text": "kori ŋina kitaŋaleununuyet ŋidekesyo, kori ŋina kirworet ŋaŋajepa ŋuna egelaaka kori akisileereun ŋuna irworoe a ŋaŋajepa a ŋuna egelaaka. ",
          "type": "text",
